        target="_blank"
        data-umami-event="map-link-clicked"
        data-umami-event-location="Sandusky, OH"
      >
        Sandusky, OH </a
      >&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Attendees:</b> 565
    </p>
    <hr />
    <div class="buttons">
      <a
        href="https://www.start.gg/tournament/riptide-2026-4/event/melee-singles"
